What is the output of following function for start pointing to first node of the following linked list: 1->2->3->4->5->6?
void fun(struct node* start)
{
    if(start == NULL)
        return;
    printf("%d ", start->data);
    if(start->next != NULL )
        fun(start->next->next);
    printf("%d ", start->data);
}
(a) 1 4 6 6 4 1
(b) 1 3 5 1 3 5
(c) 1 2 3 5
(d) 1 3 5 5 3 1

